      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I'm here on business.",
      "JA_current": "仕事で来た。",
      "JA_new": "仕事の話で来た。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1499,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I take it you want something from me.",
      "JA_current": "俺からの何かを望んでるようだが。",
      "JA_new": "俺に何か頼みがあるんだろう？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_11#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1502,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_11",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I shot down a pig on my way here. They say it's a valuable one.",
      "JA_current": "ここに来る途中、1匹のブタを撃ち殺した。価値あることだと言ってたが。",
      "JA_new": "ここへ来る途中、ボアを仕留めた。価値があるらしい。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "11",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_12#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1511,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_12",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I had a little \"chat\" with Tyran of Freedom. Basically, he understood his mistake and promised to behave in the future. I'm pretty sure he won't be breaking his word - the dead don't lie.",
      "JA_current": "Freedom の Tyran とちょっくら「チャット」した。基本的に、ヤツは自分のミスを理解し、今後は行儀よくすると約束した。かなり信用しているよ、ヤツは約束を破らない ― 死人は嘘をつかないからな。",
      "JA_new": "フリーダムのタイランと少し「話」をしてきた。奴は自分の間違いを認めて、今後は大人しくするって約束したよ。死人は嘘をつかないから、約束を破る心配もない。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "12",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_13#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1520,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_13",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Didn't Voronin tell you anything?",
      "JA_current": "Voronin が何か言ってなかったか？",
      "JA_new": "ヴォロニンから何も聞いてないのか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "13",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1505,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I heard you shot Borov. You deserve to get some cash and a decent gun for that. Do your new weapon justice!",
      "JA_current": "Borov を撃ったことは聞いている。いくらかの現金とそれなりの銃を得るのに値するよ。新しい武器をしっかり評価してくれよな！",
      "JA_new": "ボロフを撃ち殺したそうだな。その腕前なら、金とまともな銃をもらう資格がある。新しい銃を使いこなしてみせろ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_121#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1514,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_121",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Tyran was a real pain in the ass for us! I'm glad you terminated him. Here is your reward - I think you'll appreciate this.",
      "JA_current": "俺たちにとって、Tyran は本当に悩みの種だった！ お前がヤツの問題を終わらせてくれて、うれしいよ。そら、報酬だ ― S14 Thunder、俺たちのトレードマークの武器だぜ。",
      "JA_new": "タイランには手を焼かされてた！ 始末してくれて助かったよ。報酬だ。気に入ると思うぞ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "121",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_131#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1523,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_131",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Wow, congratulations! It's quite an achievement to kill Freedom's leader. Man, I wish I was as tough as you.",
      "JA_current": "わお、おめでとう！ Freedom のリーダーを殺すことは、相当な手柄だ。なあ、お前みたいにタフになりたいんだが。",
      "JA_new": "すごいな、おめでとう！ フリーダムのリーダーを倒すなんて、大したもんだ。俺もお前くらい強ければな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "131",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_1111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1508,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_1111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Don't you worry about that.",
      "JA_current": "それは心配するな。",
      "JA_new": "心配するな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "1111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_1211#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1517,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_1211",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Not bad. I'm off to do more of the same. See you.",
      "JA_current": "悪くない。似たようなことするために、行くよ。あばよ。",
      "JA_new": "悪くないな。じゃあ次も同じ調子でやってくる。またな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "1211",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_1311#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1526,
      "string_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward_1311",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Get plenty of exercise, eat your veggies, and listen to your mother. Thanks for the new equipment. I'm off.",
      "JA_current": "たくさん運動して、野菜を食べて、ママの言うことを聞くことだ。新しい装備をありがとう。俺は行くよ。",
      "JA_new": "毎日運動して、野菜も食べて、お母さんの言うことを聞くんだな。新しい装備をありがとう。じゃあ行くよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_zavskald_reward",
          "phrase_id": "1311",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
